      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MARZELLE MAISIE (8) flew the lids and led throughout to get off the mark with her maiden win, then finished a 16 length eighth last start at Shepparton over 390m (23.42). Will break from a wide draw. Better than latest and can atone here. SPACE KING (1) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing fifth (24.80) in a Rank Limit - Restricted Win at this track. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings five times from seven starts. Worth another chance. EVENTFUL DASH (2) turned in a modest effort most recently when sixth at Healesville over 350m behind Downer Road (19.91) in a Bottom Up - Grade 7. Can figure in the finish. EXCITABLE DASH (3) cannot be ruled out.",
